摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Devin Connect 反代为 OpenAI Chat Completions 兼容协议的 dsh 插件，服务 glm-5.2 / swe-1.7","id":"gh:1339258182","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-devin-bridge","slug":"Arborsm/dsh-plugin-devin-bridge","topics":["devin","dsh-plugin","openai","proxy"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Devin Connect 反代为 OpenAI Chat Completions 兼容协议的 dsh 插件，服务 glm-5.2 / swe-1.7"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-devin-bridge"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A dsh LLM adapter plugin that bridges Devin's Connect RPC API into the dsh model provider system, en"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"abling dsh's internal agent loop to use Devin-hosted models (`glm-5.2`, `swe-1.7`, and any other mod"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"el Devin exposes) as backends."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The plugin registers a `devin` provider route on `ctx.llm` via the dsh LLM seam (`LlmAdapter`). When"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" dsh's agent loop routes a request to `provider: devin`, the adapter:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"1. Translates dsh's `GenerateOptions` (messages, tools, system prompt, images) into Devin's `GetChat"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"MessageRequest` protobuf\n2. Streams the response from Devin's Connect RPC endpoint\n3. Decodes each `"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"GetChatMessageResponse` frame into dsh's `StreamChunk` protocol (text deltas, reasoning deltas, tool"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"-call deltas, usage, finish)"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Token resolution"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The adapter needs a Devin session token (format: `devin-session-token$<...>`) to authenticate. It re"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"solves the token in priority order:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"1. **Settings panel** — set `token` in the dsh settings UI (marked as secret, auto-redacted in wire "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"responses)\n2. **Entry config** — `config.token` in the plugin composition\n3. **Devin CLI credentials"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"** — automatically read from `credentials.toml` created by `devin auth login`:\n- Windows: `%APPDATA%"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"\\devin\\credentials.toml`\n- macOS/Linux: `~/.local/share/devin/credentials.toml` (or `$XDG_DATA_HOME/"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"devin/credentials.toml`)\n- Override path with `DEVIN_CREDENTIALS_PATH` environment variable"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"If no token is found, the plugin throws at startup with a actionable error message."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"All fields are optional — the plugin works out of the box once a token is available (via settings pa"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"nel, entry config, or credentials.toml)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"When the dsh settings service is available, all of the above can be adjusted at runtime through the "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"settings panel — changes take effect immediately (`live` applies). The `token` field is marked `role"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"('secret')` so it is automatically redacted in settings descriptors returned to wire surfaces."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Once configured, dsh's model selector will show `Devin` as a provider with available models. Select "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"any model in the dsh UI or route to it programmatically with `provider: devin`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Dynamic model catalog**: Fetches the live model list from Devin via `GetCascadeModelConfigs` RPC"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" (5-minute TTL cache), merging user-configured models as fallback. Network failures gracefully fall "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"back to the static config.\n- **Text streaming**: Full text delta streaming with block assembly\n- **R"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"easoning/thinking**: Reasoning content mapped to dsh's `reasoning` block type\n- **Tool calls**: Devi"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"n tool-call deltas translated to dsh's `tool-call` blocks\n- **Image support**: Vision-capable models"},{"id":"p21s6","text":" accept image inputs via dsh's attachment system\n- **Token usage**: Input/output token accounting re"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"ported to dsh\n- **System prompt sanitization**: Identity-agnostic system prompt rewriting for cross-"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"model compatibility\n- **Proxy support**: Optional outbound HTTP/HTTPS/SOCKS5 proxy\n- **Settings pane"},{"id":"p21s9","text":"l integration**: Runtime-adjustable configuration via dsh settings service\n- **Credential auto-detec"},{"id":"p21s10","text":"tion**: Reads `devin auth login` credentials when no explicit token is configured"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
